K12d / K11k: OVPN install data and frozen base64-prefix defect, 2026-09-28

Base 1557ac7. No kernel/compiler source, original script, helper executable,
peer count, key bytes or program timeout is changed by this repair.

RED / packaging repair
  Historical 970-program pair: all seven net/ovpn scripts FAIL before useful
  execution; common.sh cannot read udp_peers.txt or tcp_peers.txt. Its frozen
  Makefile installs only common.sh as TEST_FILES and omits both tables and
  data64.key. A new Python regression fails on missing udp_peers.txt.
  install_runtime_helpers now copies exactly those three frozen inputs when
  net/ovpn is actually installed, records their paths, and fails if a required
  source file is absent. It does not invent key material or reduce the topology.
  All 262 K1 regressions, targeted Ruff and git diff --check PASS.

